      "content": "idk, \"sleight-of-hand\" sounds a bit weird lol. u mean like how the integration works to cancel out everything else? can u walk me through the actual step by step of how the \"extraction\" happens? like if i have a signal that's just a pure sine wave at 10hz, how does the math mathematically zero out every other frequency?",
